      "t": "A",
      "n": "Intro2Audio"
    },
    {
      "s": "COOKIE: Ganders, drakes, and tiercels are all the male versions of common birds, but a peahen\r\nJIMMY: ... is a female peacock!",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "744232_1",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "COOKIE: You really don’t have to hang around.\r\nJIMMY: Well, you know what they say “Birds of a feather...\r\nCOOKIE: ...get out of my office...together”",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "744233_1",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Say Oscar-nominated director Greta Gerwig (JIMMY: She’s great! COOKIE: [stubmling a bit] Uh... yeah, anyway... say Greta Gerwig...) made a sequel to Lady Bird. (JIMMY: I love it! She should!“) If the sequel was titled Man Bird who would definitely NOT be cast? (JIMMY: Good question! COOKIE: Stop interuppting!”)",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "744229_1",
      "n": "QuestionAudio"
    }
  ]
